  "body": "It'd be really convenient if you could initialize a search params with an object. It'd cover a lot of use-cases far more concisely than having to imperatively mutate an object post-construction:\n\n``` javascript\nnew URLSearchParams({\n  some: dynamicValue,\n  [aDynamicKey]: dynamicValue,\n});\n```\n\nEqually it'd be nice if this worked with a `Map`, or iterators that produce `[k,v]` tuples.\n",
